    <!-- ==================== WEEK 8 ==================== -->
    <h2>📅 WEEK 8: Testing & Quality Assurance Phase</h2>
    
    <div class="callout">
        <div class="callout-title">Official Weekly Goal:</div>
        <em>"Write TEST_CASES.md, run all 8 test cases, fix bugs (one commit per fix), tag v1.0-tested"</em>
    </div>

    <h3>1. Test Documentation (<code>docs/TEST_CASES.md</code> & <code>TEST_CASES.md</code>)</h3>
    <p>
        Documented 8 formal, comprehensive test cases with step-by-step inputs, preconditions, expected outputs, and execution results covering state transitions, out-of-bounds protection, all 8 win configurations, draw detection, and session score persistence.
    </p>

    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 60pt;">Test ID</th>
                <th style="width: 130pt;">Test Case Name</th>
                <th>Target Behavior & Validation Scope</th>
                <th style="width: 55pt;">Result</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-01</strong></td>
                <td><strong>Valid Move & Turn Alternation</strong></td>
                <td>Verifies that placing a mark on an empty cell updates grid state, toggles player turn (<code>X ➔ O ➔ X</code>), and increments move count.</td>
                <td><span class="badge-pass">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-02</strong></td>
                <td><strong>Invalid Move Rejection</strong></td>
                <td>Verifies that clicks on occupied cells or out-of-bounds coordinates (<code>-1, 0</code>, <code>0, 3</code>, <code>3, 3</code>) return <code>false</code> without altering board state.</td>
                <td><span class="badge-pass">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-03</strong></td>
                <td><strong>Row Win Detection</strong></td>
                <td>Validates horizontal 3-in-a-row detection across Rows 0, 1, and 2, and verifies <code>isWinningCell()</code> returns <code>true</code> for all 3 winning cell coordinates.</td>
                <td><span class="badge-pass">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-04</strong></td>
                <td><strong>Column Win Detection</strong></td>
                <td>Validates vertical 3-in-a-column detection across Columns 0, 1, and 2, and verifies <code>winningCells</code> array coordinate extraction.</td>
                <td><span class="badge-pass">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-05</strong></td>
                <td><strong>Diagonal Win Detection</strong></td>
                <td>Validates Main Diagonal <code>[(0,0), (1,1), (2,2)]</code> and Anti-Diagonal <code>[(0,2), (1,1), (2,0)]</code> win paths.</td>
                <td><span class="badge-pass">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-06</strong></td>
                <td><strong>Draw Detection (Cat's Game)</strong></td>
                <td>Validates that when all 9 cells are filled with no 3-in-a-row winner, <code>isDraw()</code> returns <code>true</code> and the tie counter increments.</td>
                <td><span class="badge-pass">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-07</strong></td>
                <td><strong>Board Reset vs Score</strong></td>
                <td>Verifies that <code>resetBoard()</code> clears the grid for a New Round and resets turn to 'X', while <strong>preserving cumulative scores</strong> in the session.</td>
                <td><span class="badge-pass">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-08</strong></td>
                <td><strong>Score Tracker & Reset Scores</strong></td>
                <td>Validates score tracking across multiple rounds and verifies that <code>resetScores()</code> resets <code>xWins</code>, <code>oWins</code>, and <code>draws</code> back to 0.</td>
                <td><span class="badge-pass">PASS</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>2. JUnit 5 Automated Test Suite (<code>src/test/java/com/tictactoe/GameLogicTest.java</code>)</h3>
    <p>
        Configured <code>junit-jupiter:5.10.2</code> in <code>pom.xml</code> and implemented automated tests for all 8 test cases. All tests are automatically run during the Maven test lifecycle.
    </p>
    <pre>
mvn test
-------------------------------------------------------
 T E S T S
-------------------------------------------------------
Running com.tictactoe.GameLogicTest
Tests run: 8, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0, Time elapsed: 0.054 s
BUILD SUCCESS</pre>

