    <p>
        Tagged the verified milestone commit in Git and pushed to remote GitHub repository:
        <br />
        <code>git tag -a v1.0-tested -m "Version 1.0 Tested: 8 test cases verified with 100% pass rate"</code>
        <br />
        <code>git push origin main --tags</code>
    </p>

