    <h3>1. Comprehensive Javadoc Documentation</h3>
    <p>Added professional standard Javadoc comments to all classes, methods, parameters, and fields:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong><code>GameLogic.java</code>:</strong> Class-level architectural doc, field descriptions, and full method documentation (<code>makeMove</code>, <code>checkWinner</code>, <code>resetBoard</code>, <code>resetScores</code>, <code>isWinningCell</code>, <code>isDraw</code>, <code>isGameOver</code>, and score getters) with <code>@param</code>, <code>@return</code>, and <code>@author</code> tags.</li>
        <li><strong><code>GameServlet.java</code>:</strong> Documented HTTP GET/POST lifecycles, <code>HttpSession</code> state management, the <strong>Post-Redirect-Get (PRG)</strong> pattern, and defensive coordinate parsing (<code>parseCoordinate</code>).</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2. Technical Project Report (<code>docs/REPORT.md</code> & <code>REPORT.md</code>)</h3>
    <p>A comprehensive 7-section technical report detailing:</p>
    <ol>
        <li><strong>Executive Summary:</strong> Stack overview and project goals.</li>
        <li><strong>Architecture & Design System:</strong> MVC request-response flow diagrams, PRG pattern rationale, and session serialization strategy.</li>
        <li><strong>Core Algorithms:</strong> 8-line win detection mathematics, draw evaluation, and score persistence algorithms.</li>
        <li><strong>UI & Dark Theme System:</strong> CSS design tokens, keyframe animations (<code>@keyframes markPop</code>, <code>@keyframes pulseRing</code>), and accessibility (a11y) standards.</li>
        <li><strong>Testing & QA Matrix:</strong> Complete 8-test verification summary with 100% pass rate.</li>
        <li><strong>Challenges Encountered & Solutions:</strong> Form re-submission prevention, input validation, and embedded Tomcat container configuration.</li>
        <li><strong>Future Roadmap:</strong> Minimax AI single-player mode, WebSockets multiplayer, and JPA persistence.</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>3. Finalized Repository <code>README.md</code></h3>
    <p>Overhauled the GitHub project homepage with:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Status and technology badges (Java 17, Jakarta EE 10, Tomcat 10.1, JUnit 5, Maven, Release <code>v1.0-tested</code>).</li>
        <li>ASCII visual game layout preview.</li>
        <li>MVC architecture flowchart and request-response lifecycle.</li>
        <li>Quick-start instructions for building, automated testing (<code>mvn test</code>), and running (<code>mvn package cargo:run</code>).</li>
